# Authors

This repository is a Go port of the Hypernode distributed ledger and a
derivative work of it; both are licensed AGPL-3.0 (see LICENSE).

## Original design and Java implementation

The design, consensus model, naming registry, and governance mechanism
originate in the upstream project:

  Hypernode distributed ledger — JauntyJackalope351 and contributors
  https://github.com/JauntyJackalope351/hypernode-ledger

## Go port

  eval-apply-labs
  https://github.com/eval-apply-labs

The Go re-implementation, its hardening (see findings.md), the adversarial
test harness, the wallet/admin UI module, and the documentation in this
repository.
